---
alwaysApply: true
---

Always read all Markdown documentation before writing code.

Read:
- AGENTS.md
- AI_CONTEXT.md
- TASKS.md
- README.md
- PROJECT_VISION.md
- ROADMAP.md
- TECH_STACK.md
- every file inside /docs

Never start coding before understanding the project.

Always keep the project lightweight.

Prioritize:
- SEO
- Performance
- Maintainability

Do not add features outside the roadmap.

Implement only one task at a time.

After each task:
- Explain what was changed.
- List modified files.
- Verify the project still works.
- Wait for user approval before continuing.

Never refactor the architecture unless explicitly requested.
